  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資安韌性與社會實踐",
    "sub_ename": "RESILIENCE IN CYBERSECURITY AND SOCIAL PRACTICE",
    "describe_ch": "此課程結合理論與實踐，解決民間網路安全挑戰。由加州大學柏克萊分校網路安全診所聯盟開發，學習安全原則、資訊倫理和風險管理，為非營利組織和企業提供解決方案。鼓勵學生發揮優勢學習新技術，培養ESG之社會責任。",
    "describe_eh": "This course combines theory and practice to address civilian cybersecurity challenges. Developed by the Consortium of Cybersecurity Clinic at the University of California, Berkeley, it focuses on learning security principles, information ethics, and risk management to provide solutions for nonprofits and businesses. Encouraging students to leverage strengths and learn new technologies fosters a culture of corporate social responsibility, particularly in ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) practices.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
